Jungle Villas in Ubud Bali | Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens
Jungle Villas
Indulge in the ultimate luxury in our exquisite villas, where elegance meets privacy. Each villa is a private oasis, featuring spacious living areas, bespoke furnishings, and breathtaking views. Enjoy your secluded outdoor sanctuary, complete with lavish amenities and personalized service designed for your comfort. Experience a serene escape that redefines opulence—your exclusive haven awaits.
Jungle View Villa
Surrounded by tropical forest, the Jungle View Villa combines Balinese-inspired design with understated luxury. This 48-square-metre retreat features a king-size bed, a private balcony and an outdoor bathtub with rain shower, inviting guests to unwind in the tranquillity of the jungle.
