Wake to the soft morning light overlooking Ubud's rainforest. The 48-square-metre Sunrise View Villa offers a peaceful atmosphere with a king-size bed, private balcony and outdoor bathtub with rain shower, creating an intimate setting for a relaxing Bali escape.
