The Royal Suites in Ubud Bali | Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens
The Royal Suites
Experience refined luxury in The Royal Suites at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, where elegant design, generous living spaces, and tranquil jungle views create a private sanctuary in Ubud. Thoughtfully designed for comfort and relaxation, each suite offers a graceful balance of timeless style, modern amenities, and warm Balinese hospitality. Whether for a romantic escape, special celebration, or peaceful retreat, The Royal Suites invite you to unwind in an atmosphere of quiet sophistication.
Private Garden Royal Suite
The Private Garden Royal Suite offers refined comfort, generous space, and a private terrace overlooking lush tropical gardens. Designed for quiet relaxation, this royal suite in Ubud creates a restful stay with privacy and natural charm.
